{"timestamp": "2025-08-19T19:42:29.716971", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  actions = []\n\n  # Get the index of the desired item\n  item_index = env.world.cookbook.index[item]\n\n  # Find out which workshop is needed for crafting this item\n  for recipe_input, count in env.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item_index, {}).items():\n    if recipe_input == \"_key\": \n      continue  # Ignore the key entry\n\n    primitive_index = int(recipe_input)\n    primitive_name = env.world.cookbook.index.get(primitive_index)\n\n    # Determine which workshop is needed for this primitive\n    for workshop_index in env.world.workshop_indices:\n      if primitive_name.startswith(\"WORKSHOP\"):\n        target_workshop_index = workshop_index\n        break\n\n  # Move to the target workshop\n  actions.extend(move_to(env, target_workshop_index))\n\n  # Craft the item using the USE action at the workshop\n  actions.append(4)  # Use action index for crafting\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
